    <item>
      <title>Game day: Chiefs (5-2) host the Jets at noon CT on CBS, with Rashee Rice cleared, Peter Woods out and Garrett Wilson sidelined for New York</title>
      <link>https://www.chiefs.com/news/how-to-watch-and-listen-week-9-jets-vs-chiefs</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.chiefs.com/news/how-to-watch-and-listen-week-9-jets-vs-chiefs</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 07:00:00 -0800</pubDate>
      <category>Chiefs</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://static.clubs.nfl.com/image/upload/t_editorial_landscape_12_desktop/chiefs/ecj4w42ohytr9iaz7mod" alt="Chiefs players at Arrowhead Stadium" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>Kansas City's run game, 25th in the NFL last year at 106.6 yards per game, ranks sixth at 134.1 behind Kenneth Walker III; Walker and rookie Emmett Johnson have forced a league-high 82 missed tackles.</b></p>
<blockquote>&ldquo;Anytime you lose a player of that magnitude, it's always tough. But we do have other players and those guys will look forward to the challenge.&rdquo; - <a href="https://www.newyorkjets.com/news/jets-notebook-garrett-wilson-out-edge-david-bailey-expected-to-play-against-chiefs-11-06-2026">Aaron Glenn, Jets head coach, on Garrett Wilson (concussion)</a></blockquote>
<blockquote>&ldquo;Number one, you have to set the edge because [Walker] can hurt you on the perimeter. Then you have to be a strong tackler between the tackles because he has a strong contact balance.&rdquo; - <a href="https://www.newyorkjets.com/news/jets-notebook-garrett-wilson-out-edge-david-bailey-expected-to-play-against-chiefs-11-06-2026">Demario Davis, Jets linebacker, on Kenneth Walker III</a></blockquote>
<p>Sources: <a href="https://www.chiefs.com/news/how-to-watch-and-listen-week-9-jets-vs-chiefs">Chiefs.com</a> &middot; <a href="https://www.espn.com/nfl/game/_/gameId/401873045/jets-chiefs">ESPN game page</a> &middot; <a href="https://www.newyorkjets.com/news/jets-notebook-garrett-wilson-out-edge-david-bailey-expected-to-play-against-chiefs-11-06-2026">NewYorkJets.com</a></p>
<p>Feedback: <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/8%3A%20loved%20%22Game%20day%3A%20Chiefs%20%285-2%29%20host%20the%20Jets%20at...%22">Loved it</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/8%3A%20meh%20on%20%22Game%20day%3A%20Chiefs%20%285-2%29%20host%20the%20Jets%20at...%22">Meh</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/8%3A%20less%20like%20%22Game%20day%3A%20Chiefs%20%285-2%29%20host%20the%20Jets%20at...%22">Less of this</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=https%3A//www.chiefs.com/news/how-to-watch-and-listen-week-9-jets-vs-chiefs%0A">Chat about it</a></p>]]></description>
