    <item>
      <title>Chiefs linked to Colts WR Josh Downs and Jaguars WR Brian Thomas Jr. before Tuesday's 3 p.m. CT trade deadline; Indianapolis already holds a fourth-round offer for Downs</title>
      <link>https://www.yardbarker.com/nfl/articles/track_the_ball_downfield_chiefs_hunt_receiver_help_before_tuesdays_deadline/s1_17810_44532388</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.yardbarker.com/nfl/articles/track_the_ball_downfield_chiefs_hunt_receiver_help_before_tuesdays_deadline/s1_17810_44532388</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 06:30:00 -0800</pubDate>
      <category>Chiefs</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://www.yardbarker.com/media/3/c/3cd7bd9278f25459d8ff5fb4bc86725b4e9bcb58/thumb_16x9/patrick-mahomes-chiefs-broncos-november-2026.jpg" alt="Patrick Mahomes throws for the Chiefs" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>Downs requested a trade Oct. 28 and has 30 catches for 330 yards in the final year of his rookie deal; the Colts asked for a third-rounder and have a fourth on the table. Jacksonville has so far declined to move Thomas, who posted 87 catches for 1,282 yards and 10 TDs as a 2024 rookie.</b></p>
<blockquote>&ldquo;Obviously, you miss Tyquan's speed and how he's able to track the ball downfield.&rdquo; - <a href="https://www.yardbarker.com/nfl/articles/track_the_ball_downfield_chiefs_hunt_receiver_help_before_tuesdays_deadline/s1_17810_44532388">Patrick Mahomes, Chiefs quarterback, on sidelined WR Tyquan Thornton</a></blockquote>
<blockquote>&ldquo;Downs gives them a consistent short-to-immediate threat. Neither [Brian Thomas Jr. nor Downs] will provide a high-volume target [for the Chiefs]. That will come in the draft next year.&rdquo; - <a href="https://www.yardbarker.com/nfl/articles/track_the_ball_downfield_chiefs_hunt_receiver_help_before_tuesdays_deadline/s1_17810_44532388">NFL source to FOX Sports' Ralph Vacchiano</a></blockquote>
<p>Sources: <a href="https://www.yardbarker.com/nfl/articles/track_the_ball_downfield_chiefs_hunt_receiver_help_before_tuesdays_deadline/s1_17810_44532388">Yardbarker</a> &middot; <a href="https://www.nfl.com/news/chiefs-trade-possibilities-which-receiver-would-be-the-best-fit-in-kansas-city">NFL.com</a></p>
<p>Feedback: <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/8%3A%20loved%20%22Chiefs%20linked%20to%20Colts%20WR%20Josh%20Downs%20an...%22">Loved it</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/8%3A%20meh%20on%20%22Chiefs%20linked%20to%20Colts%20WR%20Josh%20Downs%20an...%22">Meh</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/8%3A%20less%20like%20%22Chiefs%20linked%20to%20Colts%20WR%20Josh%20Downs%20an...%22">Less of this</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=https%3A//www.yardbarker.com/nfl/articles/track_the_ball_downfield_chiefs_hunt_receiver_help_before_tuesdays_deadline/s1_17810_44532388%0A">Chat about it</a></p>]]></description>
      <media:content url="https://www.yardbarker.com/media/3/c/3cd7bd9278f25459d8ff5fb4bc86725b4e9bcb58/thumb_16x9/patrick-mahomes-chiefs-broncos-november-2026.jpg" medium="image"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Geno Smith brings the NFL's deepest passing game into Arrowhead: a league-high 20.9 air yards per completion, facing a Chiefs secondary missing CB Mansoor Delane</title>
      <link>https://www.newyorkjets.com/news/jets-notebook-garrett-wilson-out-edge-david-bailey-expected-to-play-against-chiefs-11-06-2026</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.newyorkjets.com/news/jets-notebook-garrett-wilson-out-edge-david-bailey-expected-to-play-against-chiefs-11-06-2026</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 06:00:00 -0800</pubDate>
      <category>Chiefs</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://static.clubs.nfl.com/image/upload/t_editorial_landscape_12_desktop/jets/kzzmrf3lccu32hnf397l" alt="Jets defensive backs in practice" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>Smith's 15 completions of 20-plus air yards tie Drake Maye for the most in the NFL, but he will be without WR1 Garrett Wilson; Adonai Mitchell (career-high 142 yards last week) becomes the deep threat against a Chiefs defense also down DTs Peter Woods and Omarr Norman-Lott.</b></p>
<blockquote>&ldquo;When you have a vertical element, and we have it with AD and we have it with Garrett and we have it with Coop, all three of those guys can get deep. And we have it with TE Kenyon Sadiq, he can get deep.&rdquo; - <a href="https://www.newyorkjets.com/news/jets-notebook-garrett-wilson-out-edge-david-bailey-expected-to-play-against-chiefs-11-06-2026">Frank Reich, Jets offensive coordinator</a></blockquote>
<p>Sources: <a href="https://www.newyorkjets.com/news/jets-notebook-garrett-wilson-out-edge-david-bailey-expected-to-play-against-chiefs-11-06-2026">NewYorkJets.com</a> &middot; <a href="https://chiefswire.usatoday.com/story/sports/nfl/chiefs/2026/11/08/will-peter-woods-play-today-injury-status-update-kansas-city-chiefs-new-york-jets-nfl-week-9/92676032007/">Chiefs Wire</a></p>
<p>Feedback: <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/8%3A%20loved%20%22Geno%20Smith%20brings%20the%20NFL%27s%20deepest%20pas...%22">Loved it</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/8%3A%20meh%20on%20%22Geno%20Smith%20brings%20the%20NFL%27s%20deepest%20pas...%22">Meh</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/8%3A%20less%20like%20%22Geno%20Smith%20brings%20the%20NFL%27s%20deepest%20pas...%22">Less of this</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=https%3A//www.newyorkjets.com/news/jets-notebook-garrett-wilson-out-edge-david-bailey-expected-to-play-against-chiefs-11-06-2026%0A">Chat about it</a></p>]]></description>
