    <item>
      <title>Nebraska's collapse goes beyond Holgorsen: 37 points on 39 drives since the Indiana loss, and Rhule is now on his third offensive coordinator</title>
      <link>https://www.si.com/college/nebraska/football/adam-carriker-huskers-problems-go-way-beyond-dana-holgorsen</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.si.com/college/nebraska/football/adam-carriker-huskers-problems-go-way-beyond-dana-holgorsen</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 05:30:00 -0800</pubDate>
      <category>Nebraska</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://images2.minutemediacdn.com/image/upload/c_crop,x_0,y_0,w_1920,h_1080/c_fill,w_720,ar_16:9,f_auto,q_auto,g_auto/images/voltaxMediaLibrary/mmsport/all_huskers/01m6wmsx011ema6x6e27.jpg" alt="Nebraska football" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>Adam Carriker's post-firing reckoning: the offense has fallen from third in the Big Ten in points per drive to near the bottom since taking a 17-6 fourth-quarter lead on Indiana, while the defense held Illinois to 55 rushing yards outside a fake field goal. Rhule has also cycled through three defensive and four special teams coordinators.</b></p>
<blockquote>&ldquo;Firing Dana Holgorsen might be a necessary move, but it doesn't automatically fix Nebraska Football. Matt Rhule is still the head coach, and the responsibility ultimately falls on him.&rdquo; - <a href="https://www.si.com/college/nebraska/football/adam-carriker-huskers-problems-go-way-beyond-dana-holgorsen">Adam Carriker, Carriker Chronicles</a></blockquote>
<p>Sources: <a href="https://www.si.com/college/nebraska/football/adam-carriker-huskers-problems-go-way-beyond-dana-holgorsen">Sports Illustrated</a> &middot; <a href="https://www.usatoday.com/story/sports/ncaaf/bigten/2026/11/07/nebraska-football-matt-rhule-contract-buyout-illinois-loss/92659409007/">USA Today</a></p>
<p>Feedback: <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/8%3A%20loved%20%22Nebraska%27s%20collapse%20goes%20beyond%20Holgors...%22">Loved it</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/8%3A%20meh%20on%20%22Nebraska%27s%20collapse%20goes%20beyond%20Holgors...%22">Meh</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/8%3A%20less%20like%20%22Nebraska%27s%20collapse%20goes%20beyond%20Holgors...%22">Less of this</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=https%3A//www.si.com/college/nebraska/football/adam-carriker-huskers-problems-go-way-beyond-dana-holgorsen%0A">Chat about it</a></p>]]></description>
      <media:content url="https://images2.minutemediacdn.com/image/upload/c_crop,x_0,y_0,w_1920,h_1080/c_fill,w_720,ar_16:9,f_auto,q_auto,g_auto/images/voltaxMediaLibrary/mmsport/all_huskers/01m6wmsx011ema6x6e27.jpg" medium="image"/>
