    <item>
      <title>Indianapolis Monumental Marathon: four course records fall and 28 runners hit 2028 Olympic Trials qualifying times, more than doubling last year's 13</title>
      <link>https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/four-course-records-and-28-olympic-trials-qualifiers-highlight-historic-2026-cno-financial-indianapolis-monumental-marathon-302932614.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/four-course-records-and-28-olympic-trials-qualifiers-highlight-historic-2026-cno-financial-indianapolis-monumental-marathon-302932614.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 16:30:00 -0800</pubDate>
      <category>Running</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://mmx.prnewswire.com/media/MS595782/CNO-Financial-Indianapolis-Monumental-Marathon-Logo.jpg?id=OA3065004&amp;p=facebook" alt="CNO Financial Indianapolis Monumental Marathon" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>Johnnie Guy took the men's title in a course-record 2:11:47, and Lindsey Bradley defended her crown in 2:29:47, finishing one second ahead of Isabel Hebner; Owen Smith set a half-marathon record of 1:01:42 with seven men under the old mark.</b></p>
<blockquote>&ldquo;Four course records and 28 Olympic Trials qualifying performances demonstrate the incredible caliber of athletes choosing to race in Indianapolis.&rdquo; - <a href="https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/four-course-records-and-28-olympic-trials-qualifiers-highlight-historic-2026-cno-financial-indianapolis-monumental-marathon-302932614.html">Jed Cornforth, Beyond Monumental president and CEO</a></blockquote>
<p>Sources: <a href="https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/four-course-records-and-28-olympic-trials-qualifiers-highlight-historic-2026-cno-financial-indianapolis-monumental-marathon-302932614.html">Beyond Monumental (PR Newswire)</a></p>
