      <title>Ethiopian sweep at the Athens Marathon: Taferi breaks the men's course record in 2:10:03 and Dusha sets a women's event record in 2:30:04</title>
      <link>https://www.watchathletics.com/article/13864/taferi-and-dusha-lead-ethiopian-sweep-at-2026-athens-marathon</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.watchathletics.com/article/13864/taferi-and-dusha-lead-ethiopian-sweep-at-2026-athens-marathon</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 03:00:00 -0800</pubDate>
      <category>Running</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://www.watchathletics.com/userfiles/images/marathons%20road%20races/__thumbs/athens-marathon-winner.jpg/athens-marathon-winner__800x500.jpg" alt="Athens Marathon winner crossing the line" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>Manazot Siyoum Taferi took 31 seconds off Edwin Kiptoo's 2023 record on the original Marathon-to-Athens course, with runner-up Asefa Tefera Mengisha also inside the old mark; American Jane Jepkemboi Bareikis was third in the women's race in 2:32:59.</b></p>
