    <item>
      <title>California's Great America will close after a 2027 'Farewell Season,' ending a 50-year run in Santa Clara</title>
      <link>https://www.sixflags.com/blog/santa-clara-theme-park-will-celebrate-final-season-in-2027</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.sixflags.com/blog/santa-clara-theme-park-will-celebrate-final-season-in-2027</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 17:00:00 -0800</pubDate>
      <category>San Francisco</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://media.nbcbayarea.com/2026/03/Californias-Great-America-opens-50th-season-as-parks-future-is-unclear.jpg?quality=85&amp;strip=all&amp;resize=1200%2C675" alt="California's Great America in Santa Clara" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>Six Flags announced Friday it will not extend its land lease, which expires in June 2028; the final season opens in March 2027 and ends on Labor Day, Sept. 6. The park opened in 1976 as part of the nation's Bicentennial celebration.</b></p>
<blockquote>&ldquo;For more than five decades, this Santa Clara theme park has brought people together, created family traditions and served as the backdrop for unforgettable memories.&rdquo; - <a href="https://s204.q4cdn.com/155295784/files/doc_news/2026/Nov/06/FINAL-CGA-Announcement-Press-Release-11-6-26.pdf">Dave Vosejpka, California's Great America park manager</a></blockquote>
<p>Sources: <a href="https://www.sixflags.com/blog/santa-clara-theme-park-will-celebrate-final-season-in-2027">Six Flags</a> &middot; <a href="https://s204.q4cdn.com/155295784/files/doc_news/2026/Nov/06/FINAL-CGA-Announcement-Press-Release-11-6-26.pdf">Six Flags press release (PDF)</a> &middot; <a href="https://www.sfgate.com/news/bayarea/article/sunday-morning-news-roundup-22519325.php">SFGate</a></p>
<p>Feedback: <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/8%3A%20loved%20%22California%27s%20Great%20America%20will%20close%20a...%22">Loved it</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/8%3A%20meh%20on%20%22California%27s%20Great%20America%20will%20close%20a...%22">Meh</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/8%3A%20less%20like%20%22California%27s%20Great%20America%20will%20close%20a...%22">Less of this</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=https%3A//www.sixflags.com/blog/santa-clara-theme-park-will-celebrate-final-season-in-2027%0A">Chat about it</a></p>]]></description>
      <media:content url="https://media.nbcbayarea.com/2026/03/Californias-Great-America-opens-50th-season-as-parks-future-is-unclear.jpg?quality=85&amp;strip=all&amp;resize=1200%2C675" medium="image"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Valkyries parade day broke post-pandemic ridership records on Muni (600,000 trips) and BART (260,738), double the Warriors' 2022 parade on Muni</title>
      <link>https://www.kqed.org/news/12108718/valkyries-parade-helps-muni-and-bart-break-records-too</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.kqed.org/news/12108718/valkyries-parade-helps-muni-and-bart-break-records-too</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 15:00:00 -0800</pubDate>
      <category>San Francisco</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://cdn.kqed.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/10/2026/11/261104-ValkyriesParade-08-BL-KQED-ee1fc0fa.jpg" alt="Valkyries fans line the Embarcadero for the championship parade" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>Wednesday's WNBA championship parade delivered Muni's first 600,000-trip day since 2020 and BART's biggest day since the pandemic, two days after Bay Area voters approved roughly $1 billion a year in new taxes to keep both systems running.</b></p>
<blockquote>&ldquo;Valkyries fever is very real.&rdquo; - <a href="https://www.kqed.org/news/12108718/valkyries-parade-helps-muni-and-bart-break-records-too">Parisa Safarzadeh, SFMTA director of communications</a></blockquote>
<blockquote>&ldquo;Given ridership is usually lower in November than it is in October, seeing such a big day in November is pretty noteworthy to us.&rdquo; - <a href="https://www.kqed.org/news/12108718/valkyries-parade-helps-muni-and-bart-break-records-too">Safarzadeh</a></blockquote>
<p>Sources: <a href="https://www.kqed.org/news/12108718/valkyries-parade-helps-muni-and-bart-break-records-too">KQED</a> &middot; <a href="https://www.sfgate.com/travel/article/public-transit-valkyries-parade-22517069.php">SFGate</a></p>
<p>Feedback: <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/8%3A%20loved%20%22Valkyries%20parade%20day%20broke%20post-pandemi...%22">Loved it</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/8%3A%20meh%20on%20%22Valkyries%20parade%20day%20broke%20post-pandemi...%22">Meh</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/8%3A%20less%20like%20%22Valkyries%20parade%20day%20broke%20post-pandemi...%22">Less of this</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=https%3A//www.kqed.org/news/12108718/valkyries-parade-helps-muni-and-bart-break-records-too%0A">Chat about it</a></p>]]></description>
